te reporting.\n\n## Human Review Recommendations\n\n- Human review is required.\n- Review the program-confirmed diagnostic pathways against the original 12-lead evidence\n\n> Note: deterministic validation confirms that measurements, citations and reliability qualifications in the report match ecgfeat output, and applies numeric-logic, definition-level diagnosis and candidate-promotion gates. It does not cover all clinical diagnostic knowledge and does not mean that the clinical diagnosis has been validated. This report is a research aid and does not replace clinician waveform review, history, symptoms, prior testing or a formal medical diagnosis.",
